preparation of audit schedules Work with various Federal and state agencies Remain current with Federal and state regulations and general accepted accounting principles Fulfill duties and responsibilities in their absence Comptroller Payroll Accounts Payable Other duties as assigned QUALIFICATIONS: A Bachelor’s degree and 2 to 3 years of related experience and/or training in accounting are required. Excellent written and oral communication skills; organizational skills; computer experience; and be detail oriented. Ability to maintain confidentiality Results-oriented professional capable of working independently and creatively with a diverse constituency of students, faculty and staff Highly proficient in Microsoft Suite software including Outlook, Word and Excel TO APPLY: Interested candidates should submit a letter of interest, resume and names and contact information of three references to wvwcjobapp@wvwc.edu.  On the subject of the email, please enter:  ##14## – Assistant Controller. The review of applications will begin immediately and continue until the position is filled. About Wesleyan Contact Current Livestream Events Title IX Consumer Info Non-Discrimination Statement Privacy Library Shop News Potential Students Request Info Virtual Tour Visit Current Students Bobcat Connect eCampus Bookstore Blackboard Academic Support Academic Calendar Jobs Self-Service Self-Service Alumni Give ABU Resources Bobcat Beacon West Virginia Wesleyan College 59 College Ave. Buckhannon, WV 26201 (304)-473-8000"
